                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Nit, we hardcode this in the service file, but use the get_option version here, which means that if this is ever something other than libexec, startup breaks.  I'm happy if we hardcode libexec everywhere and don't use the variable at all, because templating the service files would be a pain, but we should consistently do one or the other (hardcode or use get_option)"
